{"id":"b88eece05b709926","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Finitely Branching Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree — ZFC Tree10 Finitely Branching Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree — ZFC Tree10 Finitely Branching Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree — ZFC Tree10 Finitely Branching Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a4555bf0410990a9\" href=\"?note=a4555bf0410990a9\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in V\">\\(T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> is the sequence-tree predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S\\)</span> is the immediate-successor-set predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a4555bf0410990a9\" href=\"?note=a4555bf0410990a9\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}branching\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(I))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}branching\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(I))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every node has an explicitly defined immediate-successor set, and that set is finite in the canonical sense.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4555bf0410990a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ is the sequence-tree predicate (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4555bf0410990a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S$ is the immediate-successor-set predicate (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S$ is the finite-set predicate (see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}branching\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(I))","display":true}],"bytes":1509,"backlinks":[{"id":"a36ff77a4e05962b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FinitelyBranchingTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the canonical finitely-branching sequence-tree predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3763","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-finitely-branching-tree]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","a4555bf0410990a9","07554a796c3aa1f5"]}